{"product_id":"iqos-terea-twilight-pearl","title":"IQOS Terea Twilight Pearl","description":"\u003cp\u003eTwilight Pearl TEREA IQOS sticks are a capsule-style heated tobacco option made for adult smokers using the IQOS ILUMA range. TEREA is designed for ILUMA’s SMARTCORE Induction System™, where tobacco is heated rather than burned — so there is no smoke and no ash during use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTwilight Pearl starts with a full-bodied, toasted tobacco blend with malty aroma notes. When you want a change of pace, you can click the pearl (flavour capsule) in the filter to release a cooling blueberry and menthol sensation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility note: TEREA sticks are designed to be used only with IQOS ILUMA devices and are not compatible with blade-based IQOS models (including IQOS 3 DUO and earlier). This product contains nicotine, which is addictive, and is strictly 18+ only. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":42079672762423,"sku":"Terea Twilight Pearl - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":42079672795191,"sku":"Terea Twilight Pearl - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-Terea_Twilight-Pearl.webp?v=1769148513","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/iqos-terea-twilight-pearl","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




